        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[clamp(24px,3.5vw,32px)] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink mb-2">Modular creative vs traditional ad production</h2>
        <div class="tldr">
          <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-1">
            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Traditional: each ad is a complete, standalone production</li>
            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Modular: ads are assembled from reusable, interchangeable parts</li>
            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Modular is slower to set up but dramatically faster and cheaper to scale</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border bg-card mb-6">
