                <th class="font-display font-semibold text-[13px] px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-border">Traditional Production</th>
                <th class="font-display font-semibold text-[13px] px-4 py-3 text-left border-b border-border">Modular Production</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Unit of production</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Finished ad</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Individual component (hook, body, CTA)</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Cost per variation</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">$300&ndash;$500+ per ad</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">$70&ndash;$120 per variation (amortized)</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Output from one session</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">5&ndash;10 ads</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">30&ndash;100+ unique variations</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">If the hook fails</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Entire ad is wasted</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Swap the hook, keep the body</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Iteration speed</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Days to weeks (re-shoot or re-edit)</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Hours (swap components)</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Data granularity</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Ad-level ("Ad #3 won")</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Component-level ("Hook A + Body C + CTA B")</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">Scaling approach</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Produce more ads</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Produce more variations of winning components</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink">Best for</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2">Low-volume, high-polish campaigns</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-ink-2">High-volume performance creative</td></tr>
