          { q: "How much does modular production save vs traditional?", a: "80%+ cost reduction. 72 traditional ads at $500 each would cost $36,000+. 13 modular components that generate 72 variations typically cost $5,000-$8,000 to produce." },
          { q: "What should I test first in a modular system?", a: "Hooks, always. They have the highest leverage on ad performance. Keep the body and CTA constant, test 6 hook variants. Once you find winning hooks, test bodies against them. CTAs last — they have the smallest marginal impact." },
